@startuml CodeUnits-Overview
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
title CodeUnits of CommonProjectStructureExamples

[DartLibraryCodeUnit]
note as DartLibraryCodeUnitNote
  The DartLibraryCodeUnit is a demonstration-codeunit for a Dart-library.
end note
DartLibraryCodeUnit .. DartLibraryCodeUnitNote

[DotNetConsoleCodeUnit]
note as DotNetConsoleCodeUnitNote
  DotNetConsoleCodeUnit is a demonstration-codeunit for a .NET-console-application.
end note
DotNetConsoleCodeUnit .. DotNetConsoleCodeUnitNote

[DotNetLibraryCodeUnit]
note as DotNetLibraryCodeUnitNote
  DotNetLibraryCodeUnit is a demonstration-codeunit for a .NET-library.
end note
DotNetLibraryCodeUnit .. DotNetLibraryCodeUnitNote

[GoCodeUnit]
note as GoCodeUnitNote
  GoCodeUnit is a demonstration-codeunit for a go-project.
end note
GoCodeUnit .. GoCodeUnitNote

[MavenCodeUnit]
note as MavenCodeUnitNote
  MavenCodeUnit is a demonstration-codeunit for a maven-project.
end note
MavenCodeUnit .. MavenCodeUnitNote

[PythonCodeUnit]
note as PythonCodeUnitNote
  PythonCodeUnit is a demonstration-codeunit for a python-package.
end note
PythonCodeUnit .. PythonCodeUnitNote

[RustCodeUnit]
note as RustCodeUnitNote
  RustCodeUnit is a demonstration-codeunit for a rust-project.
end note
RustCodeUnit .. RustCodeUnitNote

[DotNetWebAPICodeUnit]
note as DotNetWebAPICodeUnitNote
  DotNetWebAPICodeUnit is a demonstration-codeunit for a .NET-web-API-application.
end note
DotNetWebAPICodeUnit .. DotNetWebAPICodeUnitNote

[AngularCodeUnit]
note as AngularCodeUnitNote
  AngularCodeUnit is a demonstration-codeunit for an Angular-web-application.
end note
AngularCodeUnit .. AngularCodeUnitNote

[DotNetWebAPIClientCodeUnit]
note as DotNetWebAPIClientCodeUnitNote
  DotNetWebAPIClientCodeUnit is a C#-client for DotNetWebAPICodeUnit.
end note
DotNetWebAPIClientCodeUnit .. DotNetWebAPIClientCodeUnitNote

[WebAPIContainerCodeUnit]
note as WebAPIContainerCodeUnitNote
  WebAPIContainerCodeUnit is a containerized variant of DotNetWebAPICodeUnit.
end note
WebAPIContainerCodeUnit .. WebAPIContainerCodeUnitNote

[CombinedBackendFrontendCodeUnit]
note as CombinedBackendFrontendCodeUnitNote
  CombinedBackendFrontendCodeUnit is a demonstration-codeunit which works as reverse-proxy for a backend-server-application and a frontend-web-application.
end note
CombinedBackendFrontendCodeUnit .. CombinedBackendFrontendCodeUnitNote

[WebAppContainerCodeUnit]
note as WebAppContainerCodeUnitNote
  WebAppContainerCodeUnit is a containerized variant of AngularCodeUnit.
end note
WebAppContainerCodeUnit .. WebAppContainerCodeUnitNote

DotNetWebAPICodeUnit --> DotNetLibraryCodeUnit
AngularCodeUnit --> DotNetWebAPICodeUnit
DotNetWebAPIClientCodeUnit --> DotNetWebAPICodeUnit
WebAPIContainerCodeUnit --> DotNetWebAPICodeUnit
CombinedBackendFrontendCodeUnit --> AngularCodeUnit
CombinedBackendFrontendCodeUnit --> DotNetWebAPICodeUnit
WebAppContainerCodeUnit --> AngularCodeUnit

@enduml